/github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98422#issuecomment-2566573601","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98422","id":2566573601,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y-s4h","user":{"login":"dbnicholson","id":6495518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTU1MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6495518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson","html_url":"https://github.com/dbnicholson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-31T16:25:58Z","updated_at":"2024-12-31T16:25:58Z","body":"I added a commit to change the editor text progress messages to use `print_verbose` rather than `print_line`. This would also affect the various `--export` options, but I think it's the right thing to do as the messages fit better with the types of things you see in `--verbose` output.\r\n\r\nI also added a fixup commit to document the `--generate-pot` option in the linux man page.\r\n\r\nI tested locally and it does what I expect. Should I rebase the branch and/or squash the fixup?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2566573601/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"